# Move the JXC61 gripper to one of its pre-taught steps 0..3 (IN0/IN1 binary select).
# success = the JXC reported INP after the move. For a pushing (grip) step a timeout of INP
# means "no part gripped / position not reached".
uint8 step
---
bool success
# true when the start of the move was observed (INP dropped, or BUSY came on). false when INP never
# dropped (JXC already in position, or a very short move): then success only means INP was ON after
# the node's unseen_start_min_wait_s (default 2.0 s) minimum wait.
bool start_seen
string message
